{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　　こんばちは　楽器吹きたい欲が高まっています🎺いつか吹奏楽部にちゃっかり仲間入りしてみたいという夢が膨らんでおります。　佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒　　　\n先日、「サンヨー食品カップスター46周年特別企画『ウチの学校、最高かよ！』」の佐々木久美篇が公開されました🍥💛\nhttps://youtu.be/RKInf8ct2Ko\n私は学校の保健室の先生です👩‍🔬🩹"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JJVK3TH5VT0J6T3Z3P8MV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JJWK0FG0X96KC1YT4EMY0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nカップスターの“C”をしたつもりが逆向きでした、、🥲"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JJXQPSXPPTR3DK0765DB7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JJZ2VZSP79WZXS5TGJ95S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">保健室の先生って初めてでした！白衣似合っていますか〜？へへ\n是非保健室にもきてみてください〜ね〜🥰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、「君しか勝たん」のMVも公開されましたよ🗽💎\nhttps://youtu.be/Z59HsgPVbWY\n今回ワンカット風に挑戦しました！色々な仕組みがあってとっても可愛らしいです〜\n実はすずちゃんと私からMVが始まっているんです🤫ドリアンミルクに注目ですふふ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JK042GFCM2NY1HWGAJZFW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JK15BR5F8F7WGM455RQNK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JK284D6TAGEH78HE0GE20","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JK36GTPCBBVJ8P3E6HPKM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">衣装もパステルです🍦🛼\n是非1秒たりとも見逃さずに最後までみてくださると嬉しいです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JK468X58C6HN0VYDBKNTE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3JK58T7RMPWMAGD7GGZQJ9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}